{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Notification-owned job state",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Callbacks execute locally via the canonical NotificationJobs default orchestration. The owner enumerates seeded groups and retains atomic Mongo run claims, scheduling decisions, pending counters, history and socket broadcasts. Every state call carries active/inactive JobGroupContext, including null Dating group, plus mandatory REAL/DEMO and service capability. Only enabled/parameter fields cross the response boundary. Requests: 512 KiB; rule/groups replies: 2 MiB; scalar receipts: 16 KiB. No automatic retries. Lost acknowledgments for pending-count claim/adjust/restore and run completion require recovery qualification; this transport does not claim exactly-once job coordination."
  },
